Date: Tue, 21 Jan 2025 13:10:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 388/652] WIN2030-16900:fix:Close the dsi config in default
 .dts

Changelogs:
Dsi panel default disable, but drm will load when dsi driver probed.
So the es_drm will probe later.
This modification only affects the dvb board and z530 board.
When dsi enable, open the dsi dts.

Change-Id: Ibea402ba70dac07eb3283bd74db1b712e7c60349
Signed-off-by: lilijun <lilijun@eswincomputing.com>
